{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2023-03-24 16:30:00', 'title': "LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. DECLARES CASH DIVIDEND", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C. , MARCH 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: LOW) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF ONE DOLLAR AND FIVE CENTS ($1.05) PER SHARE, PAYABLE MAY 10, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF APRIL 26, 2023."}